WEBVTT

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:02.199
-STER SAM KOSOVA.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.422
MISTER KOSOVA, d'host geredt fun Plashov

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:05.895
yo

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:10.232
un zog mir a bisl mer fun di arbet in Plashov.

00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:12.020
vu d'host gearbet.

00:00:12.465 --> 00:00:14.231
vu di plats iz gevezn.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.851
vu iz der plats?

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.087
yo.

00:00:16.161 --> 00:00:19.817
oyser, aroys fun lager flegt men undz aroysfirn.

00:00:20.093 --> 00:00:23.495
ven m'hot marshirt tsu di arbet, hot men gedorfn geyn fir

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.903
fir me- mener

00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:26.971
unter di hant

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.094
azoy vi du first a, a meydl unter di hant

00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:32.274
iz emetser hot antlofn

00:00:32.274 --> 00:00:35.334
di ale dray zenen geven farantvortlekh mitn lebn

00:00:35.382 --> 00:00:38.323
iz eyner hot gehaltn dem hant er UNK antloyfn.

00:00:38.323 --> 00:00:40.264
azoy hot men ⟨gemarshirt⟩ tsu di arbet.

00:00:40.264 --> 00:00:41.940
fir un fir un fir.

00:00:42.081 --> 00:00:44.319
vi lang hot gedoyert tsu marshirn?

00:00:45.692 --> 00:00:47.587
gevendt vi vayt s'iz geven.

00:00:47.587 --> 00:00:50.448
a mol hot men gedorfn marshirn a sho, a mol a halbe sho.

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:52.402
s'hot gevendt vu di arbet iz geven.

00:00:54.113 --> 00:00:54.883
un

00:00:55.108 --> 00:00:59.692
vend'host gearbet a gantsn tog, hobn zey dir gegebn tsu trinken, tsu esn?

00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:03.068
NO. m'hot nisht gekent avekgeyn, biz s'iz geven a BREAK TIME, a LUNCH TIME.

00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:06.037
un ven s'iz geven a BREAK, hobn zey dir gegebn tsu esn?

00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:09.446
SOUP, A LITTLE BIT SOUP IN A CUP, in a militerishe CUP.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.623
ikh hob nokh do di militerishe CUP.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.538
vi lang bistu geven in Plashov?

00:01:18.987 --> 00:01:22.609
oykh nisht tsu lang. vos iz d- vu halt ikh, bay fir un fertsik?

00:01:24.522 --> 00:01:25.933
bay dray monat.

00:01:26.783 --> 00:01:29.730
un fun dort hot men undz aroysgefirt keyn WIELICZKA

00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:32.312
vi nokh hobn zey dikh aroysgefirt?

00:01:31.828 --> 00:01:33.070
mit di banen.

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.504
mit di PASSAZHIRSKIE, REGULAR

00:01:35.504 --> 00:01:36.531
TRAINS.

00:01:36.925 --> 00:01:38.505
vi lang hot dos gedoyert?

00:01:39.051 --> 00:01:40.952
tsu WIELICZKA iz nisht geven vayt.

00:01:41.278 --> 00:01:42.824
dos iz geven efsher

00:01:43.422 --> 00:01:46.203
a draysik kilometer oder finef un tsvontsik.

00:01:46.203 --> 00:01:47.600
genumen a halbe sho.

00:01:48.265 --> 00:01:52.528
un dort iz geven a nayer lager, ongefangen oyf tsu nayes.

00:01:52.686 --> 00:01:55.633
m'hot undz gefirt in WIELICZKA in di SALT shaftn.

00:01:56.027 --> 00:01:59.767
ven du bist arayngekumen in WIELICZKA in di lager, vi nokh hot dos oysgezen?

00:01:59.959 --> 00:02:02.602
m'hot undz registrirt alemen.

00:02:02.828 --> 00:02:07.057
m'hot undz, damolst hobn mir nisht gehat keyn NUMBER, hot men undz gerufn FLUCHTLINGE

00:02:07.975 --> 00:02:09.167
un

00:02:09.477 --> 00:02:12.002
yeder eyner hot gegat zayn plats oyf di

00:02:12.852 --> 00:02:15.782
oyf di pritshes hot men undz gerufn vu m'hot geshlofn.

00:02:15.788 --> 00:02:17.587
vi hobn oysgezen di barakn?

00:02:18.387 --> 00:02:22.059
holtserne barakn. bay v- vinter iz geven kalt dort.

00:02:22.858 --> 00:02:25.602
dos iz geven vinter tsayt ven du bist arayngekumen?

00:02:25.727 --> 00:02:26.615
ye.

00:02:27.938 --> 00:02:30.615
hostu gegat a mantl ongetun, epes

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.412
dos vos ikh, dos vos yeder eyner hot gehat, dem JACKET un di PANTS

00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:35.660
un a hitl

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.989
un di hiltserne shikh. NO zokn.

00:02:38.839 --> 00:02:40.790
me flegt aroysgeyn tsu di arbet

00:02:42.776 --> 00:02:46.275
flegt men oyslodn tsement BAGS

00:02:46.737 --> 00:02:48.784
flegn mir, flegn mir

00:02:48.784 --> 00:02:50.691
tsuganvenen di, di BAGS

00:02:50.691 --> 00:02:52.378
di papirn in di BAGS

00:02:52.378 --> 00:02:53.514
un

00:02:53.537 --> 00:02:56.838
tsu makhn varem di BACK, zol nisht zayn azoy kalt fun vint

00:02:56.878 --> 00:02:59.707
flegt men oykhet krign geshlogn far vos m'hot undz gehaltn.

00:02:59.781 --> 00:03:01.260
nisht getort dos tun.

00:03:01.452 --> 00:03:04.736
oder m'hot marshirt, oyf di vegn iz gevezn frukht

00:03:05.012 --> 00:03:07.862
flegt arunterfaln fun di beymer a epl, a PEAR

00:03:07.862 --> 00:03:11.392
emetser hot zikh ayngeboygn, er hot genumen, a zets ibern kop.

00:03:11.239 --> 00:03:12.988
ver hot gegebn di zets?

00:03:12.775 --> 00:03:15.705
vo- di WEHRMACHT hot men dos gerufn

00:03:16.555 --> 00:03:18.877
di GUARD vos zey hobn undz gefirt tsu di arbet.

00:03:20.908 --> 00:03:24.125
ver hot bavakht di, di lager fun WIELICZKA?

00:03:24.756 --> 00:03:25.880
z-

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.264
dos iz alts geven daytshn?

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.366
alts daytshn.

00:03:29.616 --> 00:03:33.137
in WIELICZKA iz geven elektrishe drotn oykhet?

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.524
NO, nisht gevezn.

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:41.856
s'iz geven,

00:03:41.856 --> 00:03:45.439
a molt ven emetser hot antlofn ober prubirt tsu antloyfn?

00:03:45.816 --> 00:03:48.172
a sakh mol prubirt men tsu antloyfn.

00:03:49.174 --> 00:03:52.172
hostu dikh aleyn prubirt tsu antloyfn a mol?

00:03:51.418 --> 00:03:52.188
NO.

00:03:52.347 --> 00:03:55.682
kh'hob nor g- gezukht a veg nisht tsu krign geshlogn.

00:03:56.143 --> 00:04:01.216
UNK bay di daytshn iz geven a gezets az emetser iz geven krank, hot men im arayngeshikt in lazaret.

00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:03.511
lazaret iz oyf daytsh a shpitol

00:04:03.552 --> 00:04:05.824
un fun dort iz er shoyn nisht aroysgekumen.

00:04:06.403 --> 00:04:09.991
dos iz geven di ende. v- m'hot nisht getor- gekent zogn az m'iz krank.

00:04:10.538 --> 00:04:12.877
m'iz krank, m'hot gemuzt geyn tsu der arbet.

00:04:13.069 --> 00:04:15.678
bistu a molt geven kl- krank in lager?

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.463
in BLIZYN iz geven a TYPHUS.

00:04:19.043 --> 00:04:21.450
a BRZ- a, a boykh tifus.

00:04:21.793 --> 00:04:23.036
hot men

00:04:23.194 --> 00:04:25.179
hot men dort farbrent ale

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:28.554
barakn un altsding, un m'hot undz avekgefirt in Plashov.

00:04:28.999 --> 00:04:32.030
ober dayn gezunt, vi iz geven dayn gezuntheyt?

00:04:31.176 --> 00:04:35.810
m'hot undz gegebn bloyz shvartse kave tsu trinken. dos iz geven di MEDICINE.

00:04:35.968 --> 00:04:37.126
nisht keyn esn.

00:04:40.525 --> 00:04:45.041
bay nakht ven du bist geven in di barakn, vos hostu geredt mit di andere heftlingen?

00:04:45.908 --> 00:04:48.433
vos hobn zey zikh geredt tsuzamen tsvishn zikh?

00:04:48.658 --> 00:04:50.384
vos vet zayn di ende ⟨OF THEM⟩

00:04:50.384 --> 00:04:51.684
tsu dervartn

00:04:51.684 --> 00:04:53.242
di ende OF Hitlern.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:54.929
hostu gevu-

00:04:53.704 --> 00:04:57.900
iz geven a, geven barakn fun froyen un barakn fun mener.

00:04:58.243 --> 00:05:00.532
a sakh mol fleg ikh arbetn in di KITCHEN

00:05:00.606 --> 00:05:03.114
trogn di groyse KOCIOLn esn

00:05:03.559 --> 00:05:04.886
in di barakn

00:05:05.263 --> 00:05:06.354
far di froyen.

00:05:06.394 --> 00:05:09.003
BUT s'iz geven vakh mener

00:05:09.162 --> 00:05:10.185
daytshn

00:05:10.275 --> 00:05:14.701
hobn zey gehat a gezets, afile zey hobn bavakht di v- vayber, di froyen barakn

00:05:14.701 --> 00:05:17.036
zey hobn nisht getort hobn keyn SEX mit THEM.

00:05:17.042 --> 00:05:18.740
oyb m'hot gekhapt a

00:05:18.848 --> 00:05:21.592
a daytsh LIKE THIS, hot men im oykhet oyfgehongen.

00:05:22.392 --> 00:05:23.094
nu

00:05:22.948 --> 00:05:24.540
hostu dos gezen a mol?

00:05:24.501 --> 00:05:26.604
⟨er⟩ hot oyfgehongen? yo, in lager.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:35.140
hostu gevust vos tut zikh in,

00:05:34.356 --> 00:05:35.514
in di krig?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.590
in di krig, in EUROPE, in DEUTSCHLAND, in

00:05:36.212 --> 00:05:37.809
SURE hot men gevust.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:40.570
in Poyln, hostu gevust vos pasirt mit di andere yidn?

00:05:40.313 --> 00:05:42.922
m'hot gevust az m'hot likvidirt Poyln di yidn.

00:05:44.093 --> 00:05:45.521
SURE hot men gevust.

00:05:45.257 --> 00:05:47.563
hostu gevust fun di amerikaner oykhet?

00:05:47.637 --> 00:05:52.845
m'hot ge- m'hot gehoft. m'hot geredt tsvishn zikh. m'hot gehoft az di amerikaner veln undz kumen bafrayen.

00:05:52.902 --> 00:05:54.752
dos alts. nisht di rusn.

00:05:57.036 --> 00:05:59.443
un vi lang bistu geven in WIELICZKA?

00:06:02.335 --> 00:06:04.506
in WIELICZKA a tsvey monat denk ikh

00:06:04.731 --> 00:06:07.492
un fun dortn ⟨hot men⟩ shoyn undz aroysgefirt keyn Estraykh.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:10.997
vi nokh hobn zey dikh aroysgefirt?

00:06:09.675 --> 00:06:11.069
oykh mit di banen.

00:06:10.997 --> 00:06:12.268
vos far a ban?

00:06:12.055 --> 00:06:14.107
no- nisht di farmakhte vagonen.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:17.257
fun di lagern hobn zey undz, fun di arbets lagern

00:06:17.257 --> 00:06:20.182
hobn zey undz gefirt di REGULAR banen.

00:06:20.998 --> 00:06:24.232
tsu farnikhtn hobn zey gefirt in di farmakhte vagonen.

00:06:25.757 --> 00:06:27.340
bistu geven

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:31.421
tsuzamen mit andere mentshn fun Sokolov ⟨over⟩ f- ober fun Byalistok?

00:06:30.364 --> 00:06:34.745
yo., afile bafrayt gevorn mit Sokolover mentshn.

00:06:34.802 --> 00:06:36.618
bakante fun dayn heym?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.491
fun mayn shtot, ⟨EVEN⟩ fun UNK zelbe gas.

00:06:38.582 --> 00:06:41.461
un nokh di bafrayung zenen zey geshtorbn. far vos?

00:06:41.788 --> 00:06:46.422
ven m'iz bafrayt gevorn, di amerikaner, ale zenen geven azoy vi shkeletn, dar.

00:06:47.003 --> 00:06:50.372
iz di amerikaner hobn zey genumen gibn shvere esns

00:06:50.496 --> 00:06:51.992
azoy vi in militer.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.607
di, di pushkes mit di

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.525
mit di BEEF, mit di BEANS

00:06:56.525 --> 00:06:59.799
un fleysh iz gevezn fun Es- fun Oystralye

00:06:59.799 --> 00:07:01.037
fun helfand.

00:07:01.482 --> 00:07:03.602
iz gevezn nayntsik protsent FAT

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.685
iz a sakh UNK mentsh hobn gekrign di DIARRHEA, di SRACZKA.

00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:10.739
un zey hobn genumen geyn in TOILET mit BLOOD

00:07:10.915 --> 00:07:12.208
un zey hobn geshtorbn.

00:07:12.535 --> 00:07:16.056
ikh hob gedenkt etlekhene Sokolover fun mayn shtot hobn geshtorbn

00:07:16.078 --> 00:07:18.535
nokh di bafrayung. vos hob ikh getun?

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:22.924
kh'hob zikh organizirt mit a tsvey polyakn, tsvey yidn, a finef man

00:07:23.098 --> 00:07:25.158
hot men zikh organizirt a grupe.

00:07:25.158 --> 00:07:27.578
m'iz aroysgan fun lager nokh di bafrayung

00:07:27.578 --> 00:07:29.943
organizirn zikh esn bay di FARMERS

00:07:30.068 --> 00:07:33.049
azoy az m'iz gekumen tsu zikh, m'iz gevorn shtarker

00:07:33.055 --> 00:07:34.821
m'iz arayngan bay FARMERS

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.456
iz zey hobn gevust az undz geyen mir dort.

00:07:37.456 --> 00:07:40.592
di amerikaner hobn undz gegebn akht teg fraye hent.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.005
vos me vil ken men tun mit di daytshn

00:07:43.315 --> 00:07:45.013
mit a froy, mit di mener

00:07:45.053 --> 00:07:49.116
rabirn un ganvenen alts, akht teg. di rusn hobn undz gegebn draysik teg

00:07:49.116 --> 00:07:50.817
BUT ikh bin nisht geven bay di rusn.

00:07:51.128 --> 00:07:52.337
iz

00:07:52.444 --> 00:07:54.938
UNK bayn aroysgeyn fun lager mit di GROUP

00:07:54.938 --> 00:07:56.977
hot men zikh organizirt gut esn

00:07:57.118 --> 00:08:02.034
un a sakh hobn genumen ganvenen fun di FARMERS, hobn zey genumen handlen

00:08:02.034 --> 00:08:04.672
mit tsigaretn, mit COFFEE, mit THIS AND THIS.

00:08:04.594 --> 00:08:07.991
far m'vet, far m'vet redn fun di zakhn, lomir tsurikgeyn a bisl.

00:08:07.991 --> 00:08:12.454
zog mir mer fun WIELICZKA, ven du bist aroys fun WIELICZKA

00:08:12.454 --> 00:08:13.734
vu bistu geganen?

00:08:13.538 --> 00:08:14.679
in Plashov.

00:08:14.803 --> 00:08:16.889
NO, in MAUTHAUSEN.

00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:21.413
vi lang hot gedoyert fun WIELICZKA biz MAUTHAUSEN tsu forn?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.421
arayn keyn Estraykh?

00:08:25.317 --> 00:08:27.943
⟨dos⟩ iz bay Kroke. Kroke iz nisht vayt fun Estraykh.

00:08:28.033 --> 00:08:30.237
hot genumen a zeks zibn sho

00:08:31.088 --> 00:08:32.904
un NO esn, NO trinken.

00:08:33.467 --> 00:08:35.823
ven du bist arayngekumen in MAUTHAUSEN

00:08:35.998 --> 00:08:38.590
vos hostu gezen? vi hot dos oysgezen dortn?

00:08:39.592 --> 00:08:41.375
nisht oysgezen gut.

00:08:42.394 --> 00:08:43.839
hot oysgezen shlekht.

00:08:45.955 --> 00:08:53.188
ven m'iz arayngemarshirt, ven m'hot ge- arayngeganen, geshtanen beyde zaytn tsvey daytshn. zey hobn undz salu- SALUTE.

00:08:53.734 --> 00:08:55.309
vos iz geven di SALUTE?

00:08:55.309 --> 00:08:58.993
zey hobn gezogt "du geyst arayn fun der tir, d'vest aroyskumen durkhn koymen."

00:08:59.708 --> 00:09:01.406
dos iz di SALUTE.

00:09:02.053 --> 00:09:03.549
⟨nor m'iz⟩ arayngeganen.

00:09:03.589 --> 00:09:06.218
dort hot men undz gegebn NUMBERS, un pl-

00:09:06.218 --> 00:09:07.835
un pletser, un fertik.

00:09:08.348 --> 00:09:10.384
dos iz geven mayn NUMBER in MAUTHAUSEN.

00:09:12.516 --> 00:09:16.374
vo- zog mir fun di barakn in MAUTHAUSEN. vi hot dos oysgezen?

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.631
di zelbe vi in ale lagern. fun breter gemakht.

00:09:20.143 --> 00:09:21.926
ikh bin geshlofn oyf di breter.

00:09:21.848 --> 00:09:24.086
un dos esn vos zey hobn gegebn?

00:09:24.717 --> 00:09:26.078
di zelbe zakh.

00:09:28.362 --> 00:09:31.410
un hostu gearbet in MAUTHAUSEN oykh?

00:09:33.171 --> 00:09:34.768
nu, ikh denk az nisht.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.391
nu, ikh denk az nisht. m'iz g- bloyz gezesn in di barakn.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:42.767
hobn andere gearbet in MAUTHAUSEN?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:46.969
vos zey hobn gearbet, hobn zey gearbet in di KITCHEN, oder zey hobn gearbet in krematoryum.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.433
in krematoryum flegt ⟨er⟩ krign

00:09:49.472 --> 00:09:51.592
A LITTLE BIT VODKA

00:09:52.003 --> 00:09:55.541
tsu g- avektsugeyn di shtinkekhts fun, fun di mentshn

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:58.022
un er fleg krign m- beser esn.

00:09:58.534 --> 00:10:02.409
un fun dort hot men undz arayngefirt keyn EBENSEE. NO, keyn MELK.

00:10:02.466 --> 00:10:06.206
vi lang bistu geven in MAUTHAUSEN?

00:10:04.153 --> 00:10:06.222
a vokh oder tsen teg.

00:10:07.765 --> 00:10:09.936
fun dort hot men undz arayngefirt keyn

00:10:11.528 --> 00:10:13.057
NO, NOT WIELICZKA.

00:10:13.975 --> 00:10:14.964
in MELK.

00:10:17.687 --> 00:10:20.043
vi nokh hobn zey dikh arayngefirt in MELK?

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.646
oyf a shif.

00:10:21.788 --> 00:10:24.060
un oyf di shif iz gelegn ayzn

00:10:24.437 --> 00:10:26.771
ayzn mit ⟨negls⟩ STICKED OUT

00:10:26.771 --> 00:10:29.679
un m'hot gedorfn lign oyf di, oyf di ⟨negls⟩, oyf di ayzn

00:10:30.006 --> 00:10:32.548
in M- in Estraykh iz dort do di

00:10:32.622 --> 00:10:34.320
di LAKE ⟨OBERDONAU⟩.

00:10:34.545 --> 00:10:35.281
yo?

00:10:35.575 --> 00:10:37.273
biz m'iz arayngekumen dort.

00:10:38.595 --> 00:10:40.158
un ven iz dos gevezn?

00:10:40.266 --> 00:10:42.538
gedenkst di yor? di ⟨DAT⟩?

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:43.821
iz dos shoyn

00:10:44.012 --> 00:10:46.250
in di BEGINNING OF finef un fertsik.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.346
NO, OF fir un fertsik.

00:10:53.344 --> 00:10:55.042
di ende OF fir un fertsik.

00:10:57.225 --> 00:11:01.606
un, in MELK ven du bist arayngekumen, vi hot dos oysgezen?

00:11:04.887 --> 00:11:07.614
in MELK hot men undz gefirt tsu di arbet in droysn.

00:11:08.228 --> 00:11:11.549
ober ven du bist, tsum ershtn, ven du bist arayngekumen

00:11:11.549 --> 00:11:14.448
vi hobn zey dikh oyfgenumen? vi hot dos oysgezen?

00:11:13.999 --> 00:11:15.818
vos far a oyfnemen ken zayn?

00:11:15.818 --> 00:11:18.009
m'hot undz arayngelozn azoy vi di beheymes.

00:11:21.137 --> 00:11:24.458
m'hot shoyn gehat dem NUMBER fun MAUTHAUSEN, hot men shoyn gevust ver iz ⟨der⟩.

00:11:24.458 --> 00:11:27.324
yeder eyner hot gehat a NUMBER, nisht keyn NAME.

00:11:27.769 --> 00:11:30.041
vi hostu oysgezen in di tsaytn?

00:11:31.853 --> 00:11:34.513
bistu geven oysgedart ober

00:11:33.591 --> 00:11:36.639
ale hobn geven oysgedart. s'iz nisht geven keyn eynike fete

00:11:36.645 --> 00:11:38.866
bloyz di vos zey hobn gearbet in di KITCHEN.

00:11:39.126 --> 00:11:39.879
yo.

00:11:41.607 --> 00:11:44.064
vos far a arbet hostu gemakht in MELK?

00:11:46.399 --> 00:11:48.300
in MELK in droysn gearbet.

00:11:51.512 --> 00:11:52.974
vos hot men getun dort?

00:11:54.634 --> 00:11:56.723
oh, ye, mit di, in di

00:11:56.723 --> 00:11:58.576
in di berg, in di TUNNELS

00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:00.416
gegrobn TUNNELS

00:12:00.777 --> 00:12:02.036
mit SHOVELS.

00:12:02.987 --> 00:12:06.297
hostu gevust far, far vos di muzst di TU- di

00:12:06.297 --> 00:12:09.847
TUNNELS bagrobn, oyfmakhn di TUNNELS? hostu gevust far vos?

00:12:08.893 --> 00:12:12.802
zey hobn gemakht STREETS, STREETS ineveynik in a CONVEYER LINE

00:12:12.876 --> 00:12:14.356
hot men undz araynge⟨firt⟩

00:12:14.356 --> 00:12:18.196
m'hot gevust az zey veln geyn oyfraysn di TUNNELS. m'vet undz araynlozn ineveynik.

00:12:18.124 --> 00:12:19.755
vi nokh hostu dos gevust?

00:12:19.153 --> 00:12:20.885
m'hot geredt tsvishn zikh.

00:12:21.499 --> 00:12:26.741
a FACT in, in d- EBENSEE hobn zey ge- tsugegreyt dos tsu tun bay di bafrayung.

00:12:27.557 --> 00:12:29.306
iz dort hobn mir gearbet.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.706
di WEHRMACHT

00:12:31.354 --> 00:12:36.225
iz geven di REGULAR soldatn daytshe, zey flegn undz gebn a NEWSPAPER

00:12:36.282 --> 00:12:38.514
un a tsigaret, a shtikl broyt

00:12:38.514 --> 00:12:42.401
BUT WITH THE, THE S.S., THEY FIND OUT, THEY WOULD KILL 'EM.

00:12:42.407 --> 00:12:44.361
THEY, THEY TRIED TO HELP US.

00:12:44.361 --> 00:12:45.930
zey hobn gezogt

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:48.290
"du denkst ikh hob gevolt geyn in di krig?"

00:12:48.533 --> 00:12:50.822
m'hot, geven getsvungen.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.509
dos iz geven di WEHRMACHT.

00:12:54.405 --> 00:12:56.069
vi lang bistu geven in MELK?

00:13:00.143 --> 00:13:01.217
s-

00:13:02.083 --> 00:13:04.827
denk biz JANUAR, FORTY FIVE.

00:13:06.606 --> 00:13:10.717
THEN WE, THEY SHIP US OVER TO EBENSEE, TO THE LAST CAMP.

00:13:10.825 --> 00:13:14.146
vi nokh bistu kume- gekumen arayn in EBENSEE?

00:13:13.339 --> 00:13:14.885
oykh mit TRAINS.

00:13:15.465 --> 00:13:17.383
iz geven tsu vayt tsu marshirn.

00:13:18.604 --> 00:13:20.876
vi kalt iz gevezn in di tsaytn?

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:24.149
in Estraykh bay di TYROL iz kalt.

00:13:25.185 --> 00:13:27.018
bay SALZBURG, bay TYROL.

00:13:26.687 --> 00:13:30.005
hostu gegat gute ontuekhts?

00:13:30.366 --> 00:13:32.626
dos vos m'hot gehat, d- b-

00:13:32.626 --> 00:13:34.796
pashakn flegt men dos rufn, a pashak.

00:13:35.378 --> 00:13:38.578
di JACKET un di hoyzn un di h- hiltserne shikh.

00:13:39.445 --> 00:13:41.160
du bist nisht gevorn krank?

00:13:42.111 --> 00:13:47.437
m'hot nisht gekent zogn az m'iz krank. kh'hob dokh dir gezogt, ven m'iz krank, ⟨vert⟩ men arayngeshikt in lazaret.

00:13:47.595 --> 00:13:49.507
vi vayt men hot gekent

00:13:49.507 --> 00:13:52.095
erlebn hot men ge- oysgehaltn.

00:13:53.248 --> 00:13:56.161
un ven di bist arayngekumen in EBENSEE

00:13:56.742 --> 00:13:58.558
vi hot oysgezen EBENSEE?

00:13:58.902 --> 00:14:00.718
vifl mentshn dort gevezn?

00:14:00.623 --> 00:14:02.321
a finef toyznt.

00:14:03.576 --> 00:14:06.169
dort hobn mir gevust iz shoyn der letster lager.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.843
far vos?

00:14:07.609 --> 00:14:09.341
m'hot geredt tsvishn zikh

00:14:09.685 --> 00:14:13.121
yo. m'hot gevust fun di daytsh UNK flegn undz dertseyln

00:14:13.127 --> 00:14:15.298
az di, di krig kumt tsu a ende

00:14:16.468 --> 00:14:18.824
vos hostu gemeynt veln zey tun mit dir?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.918
ve- ver veyst?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:25.777
 dort hobn zey gehat tsugegreyt, dort hobn mir gearbet in EBENSEE in di

00:14:25.885 --> 00:14:27.347
shteyner berg.

00:14:27.927 --> 00:14:30.435
DIGn mit a luft HAMMER

00:14:30.947 --> 00:14:34.603
d'host gedorfn haltn dem HAMMER bay der harts. di harts hot getsitert

00:14:34.626 --> 00:14:36.201
un DIGn di WALLS.

00:14:36.201 --> 00:14:39.176
in WIELICZKA di zelbe zakh in di zalts shaftn.

00:14:39.452 --> 00:14:41.235
in bay di ende OF THEN

00:14:41.511 --> 00:14:45.254
G- GANZ iz geven der lager firer, hot er tsugegreyt in di bunkers

00:14:45.254 --> 00:14:48.910
DYNAMITE alemen arayntraybn dort un oyfraysn.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.714
BUT keyner iz nisht geganen dort.

00:14:50.714 --> 00:14:52.881
geven a sakh rusn, goyim un yidn

00:14:52.881 --> 00:14:55.224
zey hobn gezogt "keyner vet nisht rirn zikh fun ort."

00:14:55.483 --> 00:14:59.049
di amerikaner hobn shoyn aruntergevorfn bletlekh fun di eroplanen

00:14:59.049 --> 00:15:00.219
az

00:15:00.529 --> 00:15:02.160
⟨dos⟩ geyen mir shoyn kumen.

00:15:03.381 --> 00:15:05.872
hostu gekent leyenen di bleter?

00:15:05.018 --> 00:15:07.374
yo. m'hot gekhapt ale di bletlekh.

00:15:06.705 --> 00:15:09.078
velkhe shprakh iz geven geshribn?

00:15:08.005 --> 00:15:09.129
english.

00:15:09.439 --> 00:15:12.386
ver hot geleyent english?

00:15:10.452 --> 00:15:12.555
s'iz geven azelekhe vos zey hobn geleyent.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.705
zey hobn geshribn az

00:15:16.543 --> 00:15:18.815
⟨undz⟩ ze'mir bald kumen bafrayen aykh

00:15:20.492 --> 00:15:23.003
ver iz geven di lager firer in EBENSEE?

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:23.962
GANZ.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.591
hostu⟨n⟩ im gezen a mol?

00:15:26.685 --> 00:15:27.624
yo.

00:15:27.715 --> 00:15:29.801
iz er geven a guter ober a shlekhter?

00:15:29.605 --> 00:15:31.708
s'iz nisht geven azelekhs keyn gute.

00:15:32.473 --> 00:15:33.766
ale geven shlekht.

00:15:35.258 --> 00:15:37.007
bay di bafrayung

00:15:37.587 --> 00:15:41.979
hob ikh dir gezogt, hot er tsugegreyt di DYNAMITE in di, b-, in di TUNNELS.

00:15:41.979 --> 00:15:45.967
in a TUNNEL ⟨hot men⟩ aroysgetribn in plats un gehaltn a SPEECH FOR US

00:15:46.193 --> 00:15:49.224
IN THE MEANTIME hot er gehaltn dem, di rede

00:15:49.298 --> 00:15:50.788
hot geredt far undz

00:15:50.788 --> 00:15:54.776
az di amerikaner banditn geyen UNK undz kumen derhargenen.

00:15:54.833 --> 00:16:01.644
un er hot gehaltn shoyn a HELICOPTER bay, in di zayt, glaykh vi hot er f- geendikt dem redn iz er antlofn mitn HELICOPTER.

00:16:02.646 --> 00:16:04.651
un a por minut L- LATER

00:16:04.651 --> 00:16:06.251
di amerikaner arayngekumen.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.508
hobn di ale daytshn avekgevorfn di biksn.

00:16:10.037 --> 00:16:11.516
zey hobn nisht gevolt mer

00:16:13.193 --> 00:16:14.655
un den

00:16:14.745 --> 00:16:16.798
in EBENSEE vos hob ikh getun?

00:16:16.973 --> 00:16:18.081
UNK

00:16:18.508 --> 00:16:21.759
m'iz geganen oyf di FARMERS organizirn zikh esn

00:16:22.373 --> 00:16:24.645
iz hob ikh in EBENSEE

00:16:24.702 --> 00:16:27.365
bin ikh arayngekumen tsu, in a shtub

00:16:27.365 --> 00:16:28.796
iz gevezn a

00:16:29.443 --> 00:16:30.601
a FAMILY

00:16:30.861 --> 00:16:35.186
a mame un a tokhter, tsvey tekhter, un der man hot gearbet shikh

00:16:35.186 --> 00:16:36.558
oykhet a SHOEMAKER

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.191
hob ikh geredt mit im, tsuzamengeredt

00:16:40.632 --> 00:16:44.170
fregt er mir, "d- bist oykhet a SHOEMAKER?" zog ikh "yo."

00:16:44.175 --> 00:16:47.315
hob ikh im gezogt "az du vilst, ken ikh dir aroyshelfn arbetn

00:16:47.315 --> 00:16:49.005
oyb ikh ken shteyn do bay dir."

00:16:49.153 --> 00:16:52.483
hob ikh gedenkt, ikh vel shlofn dort, efsher ken er mir derhargenen bay nakht

00:16:52.483 --> 00:16:54.293
n- hob ikh rizikirt.

00:16:54.317 --> 00:16:57.635
er hot gehat tsvey sheyne meydlekh, akhtsn tsvontsik yor.

00:16:57.895 --> 00:16:59.545
hot er mir ayngeredt

00:16:59.545 --> 00:17:05.044
az ikh bin a, a REFUGEE, bafrayt fun di lagern fun di amerikaner, zol forn keyn Amerike

00:17:05.369 --> 00:17:08.354
hot er gevolt ikh zol khasene hobn mit eyner zayner a tokhter

00:17:08.354 --> 00:17:10.866
un ikh zol kenen mitnemen ir keyn Amerike.

00:17:11.428 --> 00:17:15.303
iz vos hot er mir gezogt, hob ikh gezogt yo, ober ikh hob gedenkt andersh.

00:17:15.359 --> 00:17:21.985
un di amerikaner mayorn hobn gehaltn a SPEECH far undz. zey hobn gezogt az mir zoln khasene hobn mit di ale natsyonale, ober nisht mit keyn daytshn

00:17:23.578 --> 00:17:25.698
h-, ikh bin geshtanen dort

00:17:26.093 --> 00:17:27.524
vifl dort?

00:17:27.524 --> 00:17:29.208
bay tsvey vokhn

00:17:29.485 --> 00:17:31.835
hob ikh geshlofn dort un geesn dort

00:17:31.835 --> 00:17:33.106
zeyer reyn

00:17:34.581 --> 00:17:38.928
un nakher hot men zikh ongefangen redn mit mir tsu heyratn mit ir

00:17:39.205 --> 00:17:41.342
hob ikh shoyn aroysgerukt zikh fun dort

00:17:41.685 --> 00:17:43.636
⟨un ikh bin⟩ geganen tsurik in lager arayn.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:49.210
far, far di tsayt, ven di amerikaner zenen tsum ershtn arayngekumen in EBENSEE

00:17:48.942 --> 00:17:49.813
yo

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.895
di tog fun di bafrayung

00:17:50.895 --> 00:17:54.270
vos gedenkstu fun di tog? vos iz di ershte zakh vos du gedenkst?

00:17:54.915 --> 00:17:56.765
aroystsuloyfn fun lagern.

00:17:57.666 --> 00:18:01.473
vi hostu gefilt ven di amerik- ven du host gezen di amerikaner?

00:18:02.222 --> 00:18:03.481
vos hostu getrakht?

00:18:03.403 --> 00:18:05.962
⟨vos hob ikh d-⟩ m'iz geven tsufridn

00:18:06.373 --> 00:18:07.227
ye

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:12.645
hostu gevust in di tsayt vos hot pasirt mit dayn gantse familye?

00:18:11.149 --> 00:18:12.695
SURE hot men gevust.

00:18:15.132 --> 00:18:16.543
SURE hot men gevust.

00:18:18.287 --> 00:18:21.453
kh'hob getey- -klert efsher leygn zey in ergets

00:18:21.561 --> 00:18:25.171
eyne di eltere shvester mayne iz geblibn lebn nokh di krig in Poyln.

00:18:25.171 --> 00:18:26.971
in Lodzh hot men ir derharget

00:18:29.374 --> 00:18:31.663
vayl dos iz geven in di HIAS in di PAPER.

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:39.319
ven di amerikaner zenen tsum ershtn arayngekumen

00:18:39.319 --> 00:18:42.213
vos hobn zey getun mit di heftlingen?

00:18:42.213 --> 00:18:44.521
vi nokh hobn zey dikh bahandlt?

00:18:45.574 --> 00:18:47.171
hobn zey bahandlt gut.

00:18:49.911 --> 00:18:52.520
fartseyl mir derfun vos du gedenkst fun di ts-

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:52.481
nu

00:18:52.481 --> 00:18:56.354
zey hobn undz gegebn gut tsu esn un tsigaretn un ⟨CHOKOLAD⟩

00:18:56.354 --> 00:18:58.376
ontuekhts, vos zey hobn gehat.

00:18:59.698 --> 00:19:04.906
un di daytshn vos zenen, vos zey hobn dikh bavakht, vos hobn zey gemakht mit di ale daytshn?

00:19:03.765 --> 00:19:05.449
⟨zey⟩ zenen ale antlofn.

00:19:05.449 --> 00:19:07.960
zenen avekgevorfn di biksn, antlofn

00:19:08.203 --> 00:19:10.140
⟨iz⟩ zenen zey ge- oysgebahaltn

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:13.355
un di froyen zeyere flegn undz zogn "undz ze'mir nisht shuldik.

00:19:13.355 --> 00:19:16.596
mayn man iz nisht gevezn in di krig. er iz nisht gevezn in di krig."

00:19:16.596 --> 00:19:17.850
er hot zikh farbahaltn.

00:19:19.189 --> 00:19:22.676
d'host, d'host UNK fartseylt fun

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:27.604
di akht tog vos di amerikaner hobn gezogt, d- zey hobn dir gegebn akht tog vos du kenst

00:19:26.766 --> 00:19:30.017
akht tog far UNK. vos ⟨du voltst gevilt⟩ hostu gekent tun.

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.468
vos hostu getun? vos far a

00:19:30.462 --> 00:19:34.185
UNK zey hobn geshtelt ungarishe militer oyf di

00:19:34.275 --> 00:19:36.193
oyf di FARMS AROUND THERE

00:19:36.655 --> 00:19:42.352
vos m'hot getun, m-, kh'hob dir gezogt, ⟨ikh hob zikh⟩ ganen mit a grupe, organizirt zikh esn in di FARMS

00:19:42.949 --> 00:19:46.183
un nakher, ikh hob gedorfn zayn CONNECTED mitn lager

00:19:46.223 --> 00:19:49.254
vayl in lager iz geven di amerikaner di UNRRA.

00:19:49.497 --> 00:19:52.967
un dort hot men gedorfn zayn registrirt un oyf di LIST

00:19:53.344 --> 00:19:56.004
un vos vet pasirn, vu mir darfn forn.

00:19:56.618 --> 00:19:57.956
oder ikh bin geforn

00:19:57.956 --> 00:20:01.961
iz geven di CHAYALIM TOO, di yidishe armey vos zey hobn undz arayngefirt keyn Italye.

00:20:03.705 --> 00:20:05.938
nokh lang nisht gezesn in EBENSEE.

00:20:05.938 --> 00:20:06.579
ar-

00:20:06.579 --> 00:20:08.339
aroysgeforn fun Estraykh.

00:20:08.565 --> 00:20:11.562
un di, di lager firer fun EBENSEE

00:20:11.586 --> 00:20:13.031
er iz antlofn?

00:20:12.784 --> 00:20:14.752
m'hot im, m'hot im gekhapt

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.882
ver hot ⟨an⟩ im, ver hot ⟨an⟩ im gekhapt?

00:20:20.547 --> 00:20:22.616
yo, fun undzere mentshn.

00:20:24.192 --> 00:20:25.873
vos hobn zey getun mit im

00:20:24.208 --> 00:20:27.678
 m'hot im tserisn oyf shtiker.

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:28.792
yo

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.374
EVERYBODY WAS PISS ON HIM

00:20:31.667 --> 00:20:32.929
AND SPIT ON HIM

00:20:32.929 --> 00:20:34.884
AND EH, AND KNOCK ON HIM

00:20:34.975 --> 00:20:36.943
THE SAME LIKE THEY DID TO MUSSOLINI.

00:20:38.485 --> 00:20:39.879
hostu dos gezen?

00:20:40.054 --> 00:20:40.886
hostu

00:20:40.054 --> 00:20:40.925
yo

00:20:40.886 --> 00:20:42.799
bistu dort gevezn?

00:20:42.045 --> 00:20:42.832
vu?

00:20:43.294 --> 00:20:47.169
in di plats vu zey hobn im tserisn oyf shtiker.

00:20:45.437 --> 00:20:47.152
yo, in EBENSEE.

00:20:50.702 --> 00:20:54.678
di amerikaner zenen gesh- zenen geshtanen oykhet? zey hobn tsugezen azoy?

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:55.809
yo.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.628
zey hobn gornisht gezogt.

00:21:01.114 --> 00:21:03.684
m'hot gevolt khapn dem yidishn kapo, KUDLER

00:21:03.684 --> 00:21:05.563
iz er geven in der amerikaner armey.

00:21:09.298 --> 00:21:12.020
hostu oysgefunen v- vos hot pasirt mit im?

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:14.372
der yidisher kap- der yidisher kapo?

00:21:14.158 --> 00:21:16.413
er hot farshvundn mit der amerikaner armey.

00:21:17.247 --> 00:21:18.793
a frayviliker.

00:21:20.183 --> 00:21:23.687
SO nokh dem hostu gezogt az mit di CHAYALIM

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.661
bist arayn in Italye.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:25.951
ye.

00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:28.749
mit di, mit di vagonen, mit di banen.

00:21:29.329 --> 00:21:32.478
nor dos ershte hot men geSTOPPED in BOLOGNA

00:21:33.058 --> 00:21:36.123
LIKE A TRANSIT CAMP, JUST far a tog OR tsvey

00:21:36.433 --> 00:21:39.425
un fun THERE hot men undz arayngeshikt keyn BARI

00:21:39.425 --> 00:21:42.317
a TRANSIT CAMP. dort ⟨hobn⟩ mir geshtanen a lange tsayt.

00:21:43.032 --> 00:21:47.025
dort flegt men aroysgeyn fun lager. me flegt handlen in shtot un arumforn

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.607
araynforn keyn Roym, araynforn keyn MILANO.

00:21:49.765 --> 00:21:52.914
mayn TICKET iz far di banen geven veystu vos?

00:21:52.937 --> 00:21:55.141
a kleyne yidishe b- bikhele

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.706
fun shul, a sider, a kleyn bikhele.

00:21:57.763 --> 00:22:00.626
s'iz gekumen a CONDUCTOR kontrol, hob ikh im dos gevizn.

00:22:00.936 --> 00:22:03.309
bin arumgeforn UNK ⟨VERY NICE⟩ ALL OVER.

00:22:04.362 --> 00:22:07.393
hostu geshprokhn it- italyenish oykhet?

00:22:07.348 --> 00:22:09.336
nisht glaykh. kh'hob zikh gelernt.

00:22:09.336 --> 00:22:11.325
yetst ken ikh redn un shraybn.

00:22:13.373 --> 00:22:17.316
vi hot geheysn di D.P. lager vu du host gevoynt in BARI?

00:22:17.642 --> 00:22:19.981
BARI TRANSIT CAMP.

00:22:21.017 --> 00:22:22.951
vi lang bistu dort gevezn?

00:22:25.168 --> 00:22:27.862
tsum ershtn bin ikh geven in BOLOGNA, nakher in BARI.

00:22:27.987 --> 00:22:30.377
un fun BARI hot men undz arayngeshikt

00:22:30.467 --> 00:22:31.709
in a

00:22:31.935 --> 00:22:33.768
AFTER a tsvey dray monat

00:22:33.893 --> 00:22:35.962
keyn Roym, CINECITTA.

00:22:36.762 --> 00:22:39.804
dort iz gevezn di MOVIE STARS, gemakht MOVIES

00:22:39.804 --> 00:22:41.784
hobn mir gevoynt tsuzamen mit zey

00:22:42.094 --> 00:22:45.345
yo, in dem zelbn lager. dort hobn mir gekrign gut tsu esn.

00:22:46.245 --> 00:22:48.010
hostu gearbet dort?

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:50.441
NO, undz ho'mir nisht gearbet. m'hot gekrign

00:22:50.481 --> 00:22:52.584
esn fun di UNRRA

00:22:52.708 --> 00:22:55.143
un a EXTRA payok fun di

00:22:55.143 --> 00:22:57.377
fun yidishe organizatsye, fun HIAS.

00:22:57.552 --> 00:23:01.326
LIKE EH EXTRA CIGARETTES, EXTRA broyt, EXTRA dos

00:23:01.618 --> 00:23:04.042
A SOCIAL WORKER fleg UNK undz

00:23:04.318 --> 00:23:06.674
un fun BAR- fun Roym

00:23:07.204 --> 00:23:09.189
hot men undz arayngeshikt

00:23:09.718 --> 00:23:13.171
in SANTA MARIA DI BAGNI, in ot do vu mayn vayb iz geboyrn.

00:23:13.228 --> 00:23:14.504
in dem shtetl.

00:23:14.595 --> 00:23:17.609
dort iz gevezn a CAMP far di MUSSOLINI'S ARMY.

00:23:17.818 --> 00:23:19.933
az MUSSOLINI hot farshpilt di WAR

00:23:19.933 --> 00:23:23.806
 di UNRRA, di amerikaner armey TOOK OVER THIS WHERE THE CAMP WAS

00:23:23.806 --> 00:23:25.456
hobn mir gevoynt in viles.

00:23:25.935 --> 00:23:29.051
eyner, tsvey man gehat a vile RIGHT baym yam.

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:31.296
BY THE MEDITERRIAN SEA.

00:23:31.453 --> 00:23:34.737
dort hobn mir geshtanen a lange tsayt. dort hob ikh khasene gehat.

00:23:34.677 --> 00:23:36.780
dort hostu bakent dayn froy?

00:23:36.212 --> 00:23:37.016
yo.

00:23:37.258 --> 00:23:39.715
vi heyst dayn froy?

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:41.116
RITA.

00:23:41.528 --> 00:23:43.327
vi hot zi geheysn fun di heym?

00:23:43.131 --> 00:23:44.542
fun di heym RITA.

00:23:44.329 --> 00:23:45.808
un di tsveyte nomen?

00:23:46.084 --> 00:23:47.343
SARDELLA.

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:50.262
un yetst heyst zi Rokhl, RACHEL.

00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:53.384
ven hostu khasene gehat?

00:23:53.779 --> 00:23:55.494
in zeks un fertsik.

00:23:58.015 --> 00:24:00.270
kh'vel dir dertseyln a sheyne zakh fun dort.

00:24:00.597 --> 00:24:05.299
ven undz ze'mir arayngekumen in dem CAMP, di amerikaner hobn undz aruntergelozn fun di

00:24:05.676 --> 00:24:08.370
fun di AUTOS, fun di TRUCKS

00:24:08.629 --> 00:24:12.386
in dem, tsu nemen di viles vu tsu voynen

00:24:12.814 --> 00:24:17.499
iz gevezn organizirt fun MUSSOLINI's armey, geven organizirt a GROUP

00:24:17.725 --> 00:24:19.772
iz zey hobn, un mit galokhim

00:24:19.772 --> 00:24:21.144
PRIESTS TOO

00:24:21.268 --> 00:24:25.078
zey hobn gezogt "yidn geyen COMEn yetst in dem shtetl.

00:24:25.078 --> 00:24:26.831
zey veln undz derhargenen.

00:24:26.938 --> 00:24:29.981
zey gleybn nisht in got. zey gleybn nisht in religye."

00:24:29.981 --> 00:24:32.231
iz bay yeder shtub hot men zikh farmakht

00:24:32.231 --> 00:24:34.561
zey hobn moyre gehat emetser vet klapn di tir

00:24:34.718 --> 00:24:36.293
mit a hak

00:24:36.293 --> 00:24:37.431
mit a AXE

00:24:37.431 --> 00:24:39.538
oyb emetser vet oyfmakhn di tir.

00:24:41.333 --> 00:24:44.183
nakher, nakher bislekhvayz

00:24:44.183 --> 00:24:46.583
hobn zey, hobn zey oyfgemakht di tirn

00:24:46.583 --> 00:24:50.389
UNK brengt undz shtroyene matratsn far yedn eynem

00:24:50.479 --> 00:24:53.122
gebrengt esn. m'hot oyfgemakht a CANTEEN

00:24:53.230 --> 00:24:57.105
zenen zey genumen aroyskumen di italyenishe, di goyim fun di shtubn

00:24:57.820 --> 00:25:00.311
un zey hobn zikh bakant mit undz.

00:25:00.385 --> 00:25:03.056
zey hobn ge- organizirt a SOCCER TEAM

00:25:03.056 --> 00:25:05.053
italyener mit yidn tsuzamen

00:25:05.110 --> 00:25:07.281
un zey hobn genumen lebn gut mit undz.

00:25:07.877 --> 00:25:10.301
hostu geshpilt SOCCER?

00:25:09.025 --> 00:25:10.318
ye, THERE TOO.

00:25:12.197 --> 00:25:14.773
vi nokh hostu bakent dayn, dayn froy?

00:25:16.028 --> 00:25:18.235
m'iz geganen in di shtubn dort

00:25:18.235 --> 00:25:21.945
in di gesheftn kukn, zenen mir geven fremde mentshn, nisht gevust vos

00:25:22.018 --> 00:25:23.986
az zey hobn mit undz ⟨ober⟩ bakent

00:25:24.043 --> 00:25:26.585
tsu fil italyenish hob ikh nisht gekent redn.

00:25:27.250 --> 00:25:30.090
bin arayngan in a gesheft. kh'hob gevolt fish koyfn

00:25:30.090 --> 00:25:32.964
hob ikh ir gemakht a PICTURE OF A FISH, dos vil ikh

00:25:33.055 --> 00:25:35.259
oder milkh, hob ikh ir gevizn a ku

00:25:35.637 --> 00:25:38.786
oder a CHICKEN. azoy hob ikh zikh oysgelernt LITTLE BY LITTLE.

00:25:40.699 --> 00:25:41.401
yo.

00:25:41.020 --> 00:25:43.781
un nokh di khasene, vu hostu gevoynt?

00:25:43.872 --> 00:25:44.963
in lager.

00:25:45.525 --> 00:25:50.340
az zi hot gedorfn emigrirn mit mir keyn Amerike, hot zi gedorfn registrirn zikh AS A D.P.

00:25:50.340 --> 00:25:52.534
hot zi gedorfn voynen in lager. OTHER SHE

00:25:52.534 --> 00:25:54.429
OTHERWISE SHE COULDN'T COME IN HERE.

00:25:56.983 --> 00:25:59.238
m'hot gegat a vile far mir mit ir

00:25:59.886 --> 00:26:01.044
un

00:26:01.219 --> 00:26:03.662
in mitog tsayt flegt men geyn in di KITCHEN

00:26:03.662 --> 00:26:04.892
nemen di esn.

00:26:05.623 --> 00:26:07.557
m'hot gekent kokhn in shtub oykhet

00:26:07.902 --> 00:26:08.588
yo.

00:26:08.914 --> 00:26:11.304
hostu gehat gelt in di tsaytn?

00:26:12.711 --> 00:26:14.809
m'hot shoyn organizirt zikh gelt, yo.

00:26:14.809 --> 00:26:17.227
me fleg di italyener farkoyfn dort

00:26:17.368 --> 00:26:21.715
amerikaner tsigaretn oder zeyf oder dos. m'hot zikh organizirt gelt.

00:26:22.600 --> 00:26:23.724
LIRAS.

00:26:24.827 --> 00:26:26.289
un

00:26:26.397 --> 00:26:28.905
hostu gehat kinder in Italye?

00:26:28.067 --> 00:26:28.938
NO.

00:26:29.687 --> 00:26:34.524
do geboyrn, in Italye, yo, mayn BOY iz geboyrn in Italye, in TRANI.

00:26:34.699 --> 00:26:36.363
vi heyst dayn zun?

00:26:36.538 --> 00:26:37.446
HYMIE.

00:26:37.446 --> 00:26:38.439
ot do iz er.

00:26:38.817 --> 00:26:40.650
un ven iz er geboyrn?

00:26:40.588 --> 00:26:45.020
in akht un fertsik, ven di yidishe medine iz gevorn bashafn.

00:26:45.938 --> 00:26:49.543
un ven bistu gekam- ven bistu gekumen in Amerike?

00:26:51.726 --> 00:26:54.116
MAY THE FIFTH, NINETEEN FIFTY.

00:26:54.325 --> 00:26:58.149
vi nokh bistu gekumen in Amerike? ver hot aykh, ver hot dir geholfn?

00:26:57.936 --> 00:26:59.330
di HIAS.

00:27:00.467 --> 00:27:07.363
i- in di C- in lagern hot men organizirt zikh ale yidn. oder zey hobn gekent forn keyn Kanade un Oystralye un Amerike.

00:27:07.369 --> 00:27:09.855
vu eyner hot gehat RELATIVES, familye

00:27:09.855 --> 00:27:13.151
hot er zikh registrirt, hob ikh zikh g- registrirt in Amerike.

00:27:13.596 --> 00:27:15.851
un fun dort hobn mir geforn

00:27:17.022 --> 00:27:20.714
fun dort hobn mir geforn aher, mit a shif. di shif hot geheysn

00:27:20.714 --> 00:27:22.567
GENERAL TAYLOR.

00:27:23.839 --> 00:27:26.060
hot genumen tsen teg di rayze.

00:27:27.045 --> 00:27:28.929
tsen teg oyf di shif geforn.

00:27:29.661 --> 00:27:31.309
biz ⟨ikh bin⟩ arayngekumen in NEW YORK.

00:27:32.563 --> 00:27:34.649
un fun NEW YORK, vu bistu geforn?

00:27:34.723 --> 00:27:36.674
in CHICAGO, mit der TRAIN.

00:27:36.310 --> 00:27:38.565
ver hostu gegat do in CHICAGO?

00:27:38.892 --> 00:27:41.788
MINE FATHER'S FIVE BROTHERS, FIVE UNCLES

00:27:42.790 --> 00:27:44.421
un zey hobn mir gornisht geholfn.

00:27:44.950 --> 00:27:46.665
bin ikh geven in a

00:27:47.093 --> 00:27:48.498
UNDER THE

00:27:48.498 --> 00:27:50.005
UNDER THE HIAS

00:27:50.265 --> 00:27:53.938
m- m'hot undz arayngegebn in Shikage in a hotel

00:27:54.282 --> 00:27:56.672
hobn mir gezesn dort etlekhe monat.

00:27:56.813 --> 00:27:59.591
eyn mol a vokh flegt kumen a SOCIAL WORKER

00:27:59.766 --> 00:28:02.004
un zen vos me darf hobn

00:28:02.128 --> 00:28:04.771
tsi ontuekhts oder esn

00:28:05.166 --> 00:28:06.403
un

00:28:06.403 --> 00:28:09.514
MISS POMERANZ hot zi geheysn, di SOCIAL WORKER.

00:28:09.553 --> 00:28:13.107
nakher iz zi avekgeforn keyn ISRAEL, ON THE RADIO, yidishe RADIO STATION.

00:28:13.806 --> 00:28:15.161
un fun dort

00:28:15.161 --> 00:28:18.103
pamelekh hobn mir zikh gefinen a voynung

00:28:18.312 --> 00:28:21.681
un di ershte voynung hot undz THE JEWISH ORGANIZATION

00:28:21.822 --> 00:28:23.942
geholfn araynshteln mebl

00:28:24.387 --> 00:28:28.954
un UNK oysPAINTn, un den hob ikh zikh gedorfn zukhn arbet.

00:28:29.297 --> 00:28:30.154
m'vet op-

00:28:30.154 --> 00:28:33.074
m'vet ophern a minut. m'vet vekslen di TAPE.

00:28:33.313 --> 00:28:33.681
O-
